  "biography": {
    "plain_text": "Melina Stamoulis is an Australian businesswoman from the family behind Gold Medal soft drinks and Stamoulis Property Group. The daughter of Spiros and Helen Stamoulis, she worked with her parents and brother Harry as the family expanded into property investment. She has also participated in its Greek-language media businesses in Melbourne.",
