    ],
    "word_count": 93,
    "html": "<p>Melina Stamoulis has helped oversee Melbourne's Hellenic Museum, established by her father in memory of her sister Nafsika. Housed in the former Royal Mint, the museum presents ancient and contemporary Greek culture through exhibitions, workshops and performances. The Stamoulis family continues to support it as lifetime trustees.</p>\r\n<p>Her family's cultural work also reaches listeners through 3XY Radio Hellas. Alongside her brother Harry and mother Eleni, she has helped continue the station's work after her father's death. Its round-the-clock Greek-language service combines news and music with community programming, and its broadcasts support charitable fundraising.</p>\r\n"
  },
